    "en": {
      "trackName": "CubePath: Arrow Puzzle",
      "description": "Rotate the shape, find a free arrow and watch its line unwind around the edges. CubePath is a calm 3D puzzle with no time pressure.\n\n• 840 levels across 28 shapes, from cubes and pyramids to dodecahedra and icosahedra\n• Six chapters per shape with growing boards and changing arrow patterns\n• Earn points and up to three stars for your solutions\n• Unlock six color palettes and more shapes by playing\n• Pinch to zoom on iPhone and iPad; trackpad zoom on Mac\n• A dedicated Watch layout with Digital Crown control\n• Nine languages, VoiceOver labels and Reduce Motion support\n\nPlay offline. No ads, in-app purchases or account. Progress and unlocks are saved separately on each device; there is no cross-device sync.",
      "releaseNotes": "More arrow puzzles to explore!\n\n• 24 new shapes and 720 additional levels: 28 shapes and 840 levels in total.\n• Discover prisms, pyramids, bipyramids, frustums and many more solids.\n• A redesigned collection with shape previews and seven clear groups.\n• Unlock new shapes with the points you earn by playing.\n• Your existing progress and unlocks are preserved.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cubepath-arrow-puzzle/id6818920289?uo=4",
